Synthetic GLIMPSE2 conformance fixture

reference.bcf contains 50 phased, biallelic chr1 SNVs for eight synthetic
reference samples and includes AC/AN. target.bcf contains PL likelihoods at the
same records for two synthetic target samples. Both BCF files have CSI indexes.
map.txt is a two-point monotone genetic map.

The records contain no human observations. They exercise the real packaged
chunk, split-reference, phase, and ligate executables. The test also requires
byte-identical phase output from every runtime-supported packaged SIMD backend
for a fixed seed.
